{"actor":"human:rajivguntakandla","data":{"comment":"Delegated review (user requested end-to-end run). Two defects: (1) GET /api/v1/links/{code} uses LinkService.get(), which only throws LinkNotFoundException and returns expired and deactivated links too; so the list must apply NO visibility predicate (all links, newest first by createdAt desc, id desc). (2) GlobalExceptionHandler has a catch-all @ExceptionHandler(Exception.class) returning 500, so ResponseStatusException would become 500. Follow the existing convention used by AnalyticsService for days: validate limit as an int request parameter and throw InvalidUrlException (mapped to 400 problem detail); non-integer values are already 400 via MethodArgumentTypeMismatchException. Do not modify GlobalExceptionHandler or LinkResponse; reuse LinkResponse.from. Use a single integration test class with MockMvc and @ActiveProfiles(test) like LinkApiIntegrationTest; createdAt comes from the injected Clock, so use TestClockConfig/MutableClock to control ordering.","decision":"reject","error":null,"gate":"design_approval","gate_key":"design_approval:5","source":"cli"},"dedupe_key":"design_approval:5:dec","event":"approval_decided","hash":"e7b73544795642a3b190ec6a5f7dbab0af60be9eb627fbd6721153ccfa803c45","parent_span_id":null,"prev_hash":"6955668f8edb6b132987bfe0256ec94bba187c5a82da9ca781d57a4fa7dee031","run_id":"live-recent-links","seq":29,"span_id":"496ac1f72d874348","stage":"design_approval","trace_id":"live-recent-links","ts":"2026-10-30T16:55:17.402+00:00"}
